<p>This is a listing of some Animations of Dragon Age. They are an Art resource to be used with the Toolsets <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Animation%20blend%20tree%20editor" title="Animation blend tree editor">Animation blend tree editor</a> to create cinematics and the like. They can also be used directly by <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Cutscene" title="Cutscene">cutscenes</a> and can be triggered by <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Script" title="Script">scripts</a>.
</p><p>See also: <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Art%20Resources" title="Art Resources">Art Resource</a>, <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Animation%20blend%20tree%20editor" title="Animation blend tree editor">Animation blend tree editor</a>
</p>
