<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Naming_conventions">Naming conventions</span></h2>
<dl><dd><i>See Article <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Naming%20conventions#Animation_File_Naming_Convention" title="Naming conventions">Naming conventions</a></i></dd></dl>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="List_with_descriptions">List with descriptions</span></h2>
<p><i>(Note that this list is not the complete list of Animations)</i>
</p><p>The list below is for dialogue animations and animations currently in the default drop down menu.  There are many more interesting animations that are intended for animals, creatures or custom cutscenes that can produce some interesting effects such as flying through the air or suspended in mid air.  If you are looking for something out of the ordinary I would suggest testing out any or all of the other animations not listed here.
</p>
